[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238558\">7005A04</a></p><p>1. With the window raised, undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the rear window guide.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018971.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the rear guide is\nnot damaged.</p><p>Position the rear guide.</p><p>Tighten the screws.</p><p>Check that the window works properly.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238558\">7005A04</a></p>"]]